    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalowooza muti amaani ga Musengwa Katonda gaakoma, yaaba nga takaasobola kubalokola. Oba okulowooza muti amatu ge gaasemba, gaaba nga tigakaabawulira, nga muli kumweta okubayamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mumanhe nti ebibi byaimwe byene n'ebireetera Katonda waimwe okubalekulira agho, yaaloba kubalingaku, waire okuwulirisa bye mumusaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli n'omusango kuba mwogera eby'obuguya, era mwakola ebikolwa eby'obukambwe n'obutemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaziragho muntu awoza musango mu butuufu ng'ali kukolera ku mazima. Aye muwoza ebiziragho, mwayogera eby'obuguya, memale mwasinga omusango. Mutegeka okukola ebibi era mwamala mwabikola, mwayonoonera irala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkwe dhe musala dhiba dha kabi ng'amagi g'omusota ogw'obusagwa. Kiisi igi ly'omenha livaamu musota gwa busagwa, era buli alya ku igi ng'oti n'eryo afa bufe. Bye mukola tibyesigika ng'oti n'olutuula lwa nabumbuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye enkwe dhaimwe tidhiribaviiramu kalungi. Dhiriba ng'oti lugoye olukoleibwa mu wuuzi dha nabumbuli, oluzira muganhulo naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.15+ROM.3.16+ROM.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 3:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwangugha inho okukola ebibi aghazira kusibamu, era mwayanguyirwa inho okwita abantu abaziraku musango. Buli ghe mubita muzikirizaagho, mwaleka bifulukwa byereere. Ebirowoozo byaimwe mubimalira ku kukola bibi byonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timwidhi kyetebwa miraala, era bye mukola tibijiira ku mazima. Mutambulira mu ngira engodegode, era kiisi adhibitamu taba na miraala naire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakoba bati: “Bwenebwene okukola amazima kutuli ghala, n'okukola ebituufu kutuziramu. Tunoonia obutangaavu, aye twabona bwa nzikiiza ndhereere eri bedimudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuja nga tughaamanta ku bimante ng'oti n'abatulu abatabona. Era twaja nga twekontola ni mu kasana ghagati nga buli ng'oti bwire, twaba ng'oti n'abali mu nsi y'abafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twenatwena twidhula okutya, twavuuma ng'oti bisolo bikambwe, era twalira ng'oti maghemba. Twegomba Katonda aidhe atuwonie okutuntuzibwa, aye ghazira kikolebwa naire. Era twegomba okulokolebwa, aye kwatuba ghala inho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wo Musengwa Katonda, twakola ebibi kamaala y'oli, era okusobya kwaife okwo kwene kutulumiriza kuba ebibi byaife tubibona, n'okusobya kwaife tukwidhi bukalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twakudheemera twakuvaaku iwe Musengwa Katonda, twaloba kukunonereza iwe Katonda waife. Twatuntuza banaife era twakudheemera. Bye tulowooza bikyamu, ni bye twogera bya buguya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tubingagho amazima twaloba kugakoleraku, n'okukola ebituufu kwaloba kuseeta ghe tuli. Amazima tigakaakolebwa mu mpya dha bibuga, n'obwesimbu tibukaaliyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwesigwa buziragho mu bantu, era oyo alekayo okukola ebibi bamuyiiga n'obukambwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda ekyo yakibona era yaasungughala, olw'obutabaagho kukolera ku mazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.63.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 63:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yeewuunhia okubona nga ghaziragho muntu waire omulala ati, afaayo kuwolerezaagho abo abatuntuzibwa. Kale mwene alikozesa obuyinza bwe n'obutuufu bwe, yaanunula abantu be okubatuusa ku bughanguzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.5.17+WIS.5.18+WIS.5.19+WIS.5.20+WIS.5.21+WIS.5.22+WIS.5.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mag 5:17-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 6:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Thes 5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Alivaala obutuufu ng'ekivaalo eky'omu kifuba eky'ekyuma, yaavaala obulokozi ku mutwe gwe ng'enkuufiira ey'ekyuma. Era okwesasuuliza ku bazigu be kulimubaaku ng'oti kivaalo kya munda, n'obusungu bwamubaaku ng'oti kivaalo kya ku ngulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alibonereza abazigu be ng'ajiira ku bye baakola, ng'atwaliiremu n'abo ababa mu biketezo eby'eghala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 59:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu okuva e buvandhuba okutuuka e bugwandhuba balimutya, era baatya n'ekitiisa kye kuba aliidha ng'oti n'omwiga oguwolomboka n'amaani, nga gutwalibwa empewo Musengwa Katonda mwene y'asindika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
